Table 1.3 shows the changes in census population by municipalities in Trinidad and Parishes
in Tobago. Declines were observed in the Cities of Port-of-Spain and San Fernando and Diego
Martin Region. Minimal growth was seen in all the other areas except San Juan/Laventille where
no change was reported. The Borough of Chaguanas in Trinidad and the Parish of St George in
Tobago experienced the highest growth.
